  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/langs2/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review at dev 100b6fbb6e: fixture a.h/a.m with #import plus #include <stdint.h>, #include <os/log.h>, #include \"b.h\": survey emits imports edges only for the two #import lines; no #include in either the .h or the .m produces an edge. objc.py L971-973 still reads 'Check if it's #import (not #include)'. The asked-for corpus delta and consumer check were not done in this review. MECHANISM: objc preproc_include arm emits an imports edge only when the node has an #import child."  # 4b0f
